# Redirect HTTP → HTTPS (non-www)
http://namenumerologyhub.com/* https://namenumerologyhub.com/:splat 301

# Redirect HTTP → HTTPS (www)
http://www.namenumerologyhub.com/* https://namenumerologyhub.com/:splat 301

# Redirect www → non-www (HTTPS)
https://www.namenumerologyhub.com/* https://namenumerologyhub.com/:splat 301

# Redirect trailing slash → no trailing slash (301 permanent)
# Matches any path ending in / that isn't just the root /
https://namenumerologyhub.com/*/ https://namenumerologyhub.com/:splat 301
